  m_text: '<align="center"><size=45><color=#00ffff>Tap Boxes to Return Them.</align></size></color>


    The
    <color=#00ffff>Object Pool</color> is a component that helps you manage a collection
    of objects. It will automatically sync its objects'' Active state. This example
    program will drop boxes from the sky one at a time into a stacked grid, and when
    you click on a box, it is removed and respawned from the sky.'
